                                "sense_id": "84d06e24-708b-394c-bcbf-d8c4608947d0",
                                "text": "1986, Ben Elton & al., Blackadder II, 3: \"Potato\"\nAah-ahhh! You have a woman’s hand, milord! I’ll wager these dainty pinkies never weighed anchor in a storm."
                            }
